OL,4,CSales of baby sleeping bag halted by   
OL,5,CNext after new mum raises alarm        
OL,6,GSales of a baby sleeping bag have been 
OL,7,Ghalted in the UK by fashion retail     
OL,8,Gchain Next, after a new mum raised the 
OL,9,Galarm over its safety.                 
OL,11,FEmma Hunter, 29 from Norwich,          
OL,12,Fcontacted BBC Your Voice to say she    
OL,13,Frealised the neck hole was far too big 
OL,14,F- meaning her daughter Rosie could     
OL,15,Fpotentially wriggle down, burying her  
OL,16,Fface and risking suffocation.          
OL,18,FEmma recalls: "I woke up my husband    
OL,19,Fand we both agreed there was no way we 
OL,20,Fcould put Rosie in it."                
